   Dmitry Ganyushin       : Spin-Orbit,Spin-Spin,Magnetic field MRCI
   Miquel Garcia          : C-PCM and meta-GGA Hessian, CC/C-PCM, Gaussian charge scheme
   Yang Guo               : DLPNO-NEVPT2, F12-NEVPT2, CIM, IAO-localization
